{"script": "export const meta = {
  name: 'table-concept-finish',
  description: 'Finish the concept fixes: time-boxed Sonnet refuter on both-sides duplication and fan tooltips, one Sonnet fix loop if needed',
  phases: [
    { title: 'Refute', detail: 'Sonnet medium, ≤ 60 min: the 5 fixed cases, fan tooltips, quick sweep; findings written to a file as found' },
    { title: 'Fix', detail: 'Sonnet medium fixer + Sonnet medium recheck, only if defects' },
  ],
}

const C = 'claude-code-game-master/build/ai-table-redesign'
const Q = 'claude-code-game-master/build/_qa-r3'
const CTX = `
CONTEXT. ${C} is an approved clickable before/after concept (plain HTML/JS deck, 15 slides) for a game UI of the AI-table: a large touch screen lying flat, players on both long sides; the far side's UI is rotated 180°. Shared components in components.js (UI.toast/sheet/toastFor/sheetFor/pop, board.pop/preview, UI.longPress, UI.slot/UI.fan), slides in slides/*.js, fight engine slides/fight-engine.js. Mode buttons: «Сравнить», «Шторка», «Новое», «Напротив».
OWNER FEEDBACK (${C}/FEEDBACK.md): item 1 — on the flat table every shared text must be readable from BOTH long sides (either it sits in the seat of the player it concerns and faces that player, or it is duplicated near 0° and far 180°); item 2 — long-press on a sub-ability inside a fan shows THAT sub-ability's tooltip.
HISTORY: refuter round 1 found 5 one-sided cases (${C}/stages/refute1.md); fix round 2 claims all fixed (${C}/stages/fix2.md, FEEDBACK.md item 1 «раунд 2»). NOT defects (waiting for the owner): hall of heroes 04 (names facing their own side) and personal items under «one copy in front of the owner» (листок «Написать», own-seat slot sheets, «Ждите хода»/«Ход врага», «Ещё раз», roll and reaction cards, the roll number in 05/06, «−N» at the own-seat medallion).
A previous refuter ran 2 hours and was cut off by a hub restart without reporting — so: TIME BOX 60 minutes of work, and append every finding to ${Q}/findings.md the moment you confirm it (create the folder). Prefer evaluating DOM state (element text, computed transform / rotation of the element and its ancestors, bounding boxes) with page.evaluate over pixel/letter analysis.
HOW TO RUN: \`cd ${C} && nice -n 10 python3 -m http.server <free port 8800-8899> --bind 127.0.0.1 &\`, remember its PID; ONE headless Chrome/Playwright at a time (nice -n 10, \`echo 1000 > /proc/self/oom_score_adj\` in its shell; the ai-table venv on the hub has none — use what the earlier agents used: check ${C}/../_refute3/walk.sh and ${C}/../_qa-dup/); kill your server and browser by PID when done; never \`pkill -f\` a plain pattern. Screenshots under ${Q}/ (not published). Plain-text answer in Russian (no report.md).`

const REFUTE = (extra) => `${CTX}
YOUR ROLE: refuter (do not edit the deck). Check, in the normal and the «Напротив» orientation: (a) each of the 5 cases from refute1.md is now two-sided; (b) slides 07-10 fight: «мимо», damage and heal numbers, aim preview plate, attack result plate, «Щит» number, boot-with-number — each shown near 0° and far 180°; (c) slide 13: «Кто спасёт?», «Стабильна», the save number — both sides, for a near-side and a far-side rescuer; (d) item 2 on all fans (Кощей «Чары», Старец «Лечение»/«Молитвы», «Ноги») on the table slide 07 and the phone slide 11; (e) a quick sweep of slides 05, 06, 14 for any other shared text shown on one side only; console errors; scrolling. ${extra}
First line exactly "VERDICT: PASS" or "VERDICT: FAIL". Then counts of what was checked, defects (slide, element, orientation, repro, screenshot, code location, fix direction), ≤ 80 lines.`

phase('Refute')
const r1 = await agent(REFUTE(''), { label: 'refute', phase: 'Refute', model: 'sonnet', effort: 'medium' })

let fix = null, r2 = null
if (!/VERDICT:\s*PASS/i.test(r1 || '')) {
  phase('Fix')
  fix = await agent(`${CTX}
YOUR ROLE: implementer. Fix every defect in the refuter's report below through the shared mechanisms in components.js (no per-slide hacks unless the slide itself builds the element), keeping the deck's look; do not change the disputed personal items. Verify each fix yourself in one headless browser, both orientations, console errors 0, no scrolling. Append «Исправлено, раунд 3 (2026-11-02)» under the item in ${C}/FEEDBACK.md: what changed, how it was checked, screenshot paths. TIME BOX 60 minutes. Answer: files changed, per-defect result.
REFUTER:\n${r1}`, { label: 'fix', phase: 'Fix', model: 'sonnet', effort: 'medium' })
  r2 = await agent(REFUTE(`Round 2: recheck exactly the defects below and anything the fix touched; skip the rest.\nREFUTER 1:\n${r1}\nFIX:\n${fix}`), { label: 'refute2', phase: 'Fix', model: 'sonnet', effort: 'medium' })
}
return { refute: r1, fix, refute2: r2 }
"}

